      "text": "Smaller late steps settle better; they do not travel further. Getting past 65% needs bigger, better-aimed steps, which is Part 24.",
      "originalText": "Smaller late steps settle better; they do not travel further. Getting past 65% needs bigger, better-aimed steps, which is Part 24.",
